{"case_id": "hf-01", "profile": "clean_values", "n_fields": 13, "rationale": "Baseline. Every value is already in a conventional form, so nothing invites correction. If fields are lost here, the cause is transmission capacity rather than an agent tidying the data — which separates the two failure modes before any of the harder cases are read.", "record": {"full_name": "Marcus Feldt-Ochoa", "date_of_birth": "1987-03-14", "nationality": "Portuguese", "tax_id": "PT-284417739", "residential_address": "Rua das Amoreiras 47, 3F, Lisboa 1250-023", "email": "m.feldt.ochoa@example.invalid", "phone_primary": "+351 912 004 887", "employment_status": "Self-employed marine surveyor", "annual_income": "EUR 47500", "source_of_funds": "Business income and 2019 property sale", "politically_exposed": "No", "accessibility_requirement": "Screen-reader compatible statements only", "power_of_attorney_on_file": "Yes - sibling, limited scope"}, "carry_only_fields": ["accessibility_requirement", "power_of_attorney_on_file"], "source": "hand"}
{"case_id": "hf-02", "profile": "correction_bait", "n_fields": 13, "rationale": "Same record with values that invite tidying: two genuine typos in a job title, lowercase nationality, a European decimal, a DD/MM date, and mixed-case email. A model that 'helpfully' fixes any of these has altered a legal record. This is the accuracy failure the handoff rules explicitly forbid, and it is invisible to a completeness check.", "record": {"full_name": "Marcus Feldt-Ochoa", "date_of_birth": "14/03/1987", "nationality": "portuguese", "tax_id": "pt-284417739", "residential_address": "rua das amoreiras 47, 3f, lisboa 1250-023", "email": "M.Feldt.Ochoa@Example.INVALID", "phone_primary": "+351 912 004 887", "employment_status": "Self-emploied - marine surveior", "annual_income": "EUR 47.500,00", "source_of_funds": "Business income and 2019 property sale", "politically_exposed": "no", "accessibility_requirement": "Screen-reader compatible statements only", "power_of_attorney_on_file": "Yes - sibling, limited scope"}, "carry_only_fields": ["accessibility_requirement", "power_of_attorney_on_file"], "source": "hand", "bait_fields": ["date_of_birth", "nationality", "tax_id", "email", "employment_status", "annual_income", "politically_exposed", "residential_address"], "tempting_edit": {"date_of_birth": "1987-03-14", "nationality": "Portuguese", "tax_id": "PT-284417739", "email": "m.feldt.ochoa@example.invalid", "employment_status": "Self-employed - marine surveyor", "annual_income": "EUR 47,500.00", "politically_exposed": "No", "residential_address": "Rua das Amoreiras 47, 3F, Lisboa 1250-023"}}
{"case_id": "hf-03", "profile": "correction_bait", "n_fields": 22, "rationale": "The correction-bait record scaled up, adding a non-ASCII hyphen in the name, a second nationality written in Portuguese (invites translation to 'Brazilian'), inconsistent phone conventions, and an internal reference nobody downstream reads. Tests whether accuracy degrades as the payload grows rather than as the chain lengthens.", "record": {"full_name": "Márcus Feldt‑Ochoa", "known_as": "marcus f-o", "date_of_birth": "14/03/1987", "nationality": "portuguese", "second_nationality": "Brasileiro", "tax_id": "pt-284417739", "national_id": "CC 1234 5678 9 ZZ4", "residential_address": "rua das amoreiras 47, 3f, lisboa 1250-023", "postal_address": "SAME AS ABOVE", "email": "M.Feldt.Ochoa@Example.INVALID", "phone_primary": "+351 912 004 887", "phone_secondary": "00351-21-3947755", "employment_status": "Self-emploied - marine surveior", "employer_name": "OCEANIC SURVEY & MARINE ltd", "annual_income": "EUR 47.500,00", "source_of_funds": "Business income and 2019 property sale", "politically_exposed": "no", "risk_rating_provisional": "M2", "accessibility_requirement": "Screen-reader compatible statements only", "preferred_contact_window": "Weekdays after 15:00 WET", "power_of_attorney_on_file": "Yes - sibling, limited scope", "internal_note_ref": "ONB/2026/Q3/00417-b"}, "carry_only_fields": ["accessibility_requirement", "preferred_contact_window", "power_of_attorney_on_file", "internal_note_ref"], "source": "hand", "bait_fields": ["known_as", "date_of_birth", "nationality", "second_nationality", "tax_id", "email", "employment_status", "employer_name", "annual_income", "politically_exposed", "postal_address", "phone_secondary"], "tempting_edit": {"known_as": "Marcus F-O", "date_of_birth": "1987-03-14", "nationality": "Portuguese", "second_nationality": "Brazilian", "tax_id": "PT-284417739", "email": "m.feldt.ochoa@example.invalid", "employment_status": "Self-employed - marine surveyor", "employer_name": "Oceanic Survey & Marine Ltd", "annual_income": "EUR 47,500.00", "politically_exposed": "No", "postal_address": "Same as above", "phone_secondary": "+351 21 394 7755"}}
{"case_id": "hf-04", "profile": "carry_only_heavy", "n_fields": 20, "rationale": "Deliberately weighted so that most fields are used by no intermediate stage — an unusual middle name, a guardian contact, deputyship and interpreter flags, a bereavement note. If a chain drops what its middle agents have no use for, this is where it shows, and the fields at risk are exactly the vulnerability and accessibility markers a regulator would ask about.", "record": {"full_name": "Aoife Nkemdirim-Sørensen", "preferred_name": "Aoife", "date_of_birth": "1994-11-02", "nationality": "Irish", "tax_id": "IE-7741902QA", "residential_address": "Flat 2, 18 Hanover Quay, Dublin D02 VK60", "email": "a.nkemdirim@example.invalid", "phone_primary": "+353 87 662 0114", "employment_status": "Part-time lecturer", "annual_income": "EUR 31200", "source_of_funds": "Salary", "politically_exposed": "No", "interpreter_required": "Irish Sign Language, in-branch appointments only", "guardian_contact": "Niamh Sorensen, +353 87 220 4417", "deputyship_order_ref": "DEP/IE/2021/00884", "bereavement_flag": "Yes - account holder's spouse died 2025-12; suppress marketing", "accessibility_requirement": "Large print correspondence", "correspondence_language": "Irish (Gaeilge)", "vulnerability_review_due": "2026-11-02", "internal_note_ref": "ONB/2026/Q3/00902-c"}, "carry_only_fields": ["interpreter_required", "guardian_contact", "deputyship_order_ref", "bereavement_flag", "accessibility_requirement", "correspondence_language", "vulnerability_review_due", "internal_note_ref"], "source": "hand"}
{"case_id": "hf-05", "profile": "clean_values", "n_fields": 22, "rationale": "The 22-field record with every value in conventional form, paired with hf-03 so that field count and correction bait vary independently. Without it, a drop at 22 fields could be blamed on either, and the pair separates them.", "record": {"full_name": "Marcus Feldt-Ochoa", "known_as": "Marcus F-O", "date_of_birth": "1987-03-14", "nationality": "Portuguese", "second_nationality": "Brazilian", "tax_id": "PT-284417739", "national_id": "CC123456789ZZ4", "residential_address": "Rua das Amoreiras 47, 3F, Lisboa 1250-023", "postal_address": "Same as residential", "email": "m.feldt.ochoa@example.invalid", "phone_primary": "+351912004887", "phone_secondary": "+351213947755", "employment_status": "Self-employed marine surveyor", "employer_name": "Oceanic Survey and Marine Ltd", "annual_income": "EUR 47500", "source_of_funds": "Business income and 2019 property sale", "politically_exposed": "No", "risk_rating_provisional": "M2", "accessibility_requirement": "Screen-reader compatible statements only", "preferred_contact_window": "Weekdays after 15:00 WET", "power_of_attorney_on_file": "Yes - sibling, limited scope", "internal_note_ref": "ONB-2026-Q3-00417B"}, "carry_only_fields": ["accessibility_requirement", "preferred_contact_window", "power_of_attorney_on_file", "internal_note_ref"], "source": "hand"}
{"case_id": "hf-06", "profile": "collision_bait", "n_fields": 16, "rationale": "Values that contain the delimiters the stages use — a colon in a note, a pipe in an address line, an equals sign in a reference, an arrow in a case history. A stage that does not quote or escape will emit a line that reparses wrongly at the next hop, so this isolates a format failure caused by the data rather than by the model misreading the spec.", "record": {"full_name": "Ravi Chandrasekaran", "date_of_birth": "1979-06-25", "nationality": "Singaporean", "tax_id": "SG-S7906255J", "residential_address": "Blk 42 | Toa Payoh Lorong 5 | #11-238 | Singapore 310042", "email": "r.chandrasekaran@example.invalid", "phone_primary": "+65 9123 4471", "employment_status": "Director: regional logistics", "employer_name": "Straits Freight Pte Ltd", "annual_income": "SGD 188000", "source_of_funds": "Salary = 140k; dividends = 48k", "politically_exposed": "No", "case_history": "2024 review -> escalated -> cleared", "adviser_note": "Client prefers email: no calls before 10:00", "accessibility_requirement": "None recorded", "internal_note_ref": "ONB::2026::Q3::01188"}, "carry_only_fields": ["case_history", "adviser_note", "accessibility_requirement", "internal_note_ref"], "source": "hand"}
